uffs for the duration. At the end of the duration, the unit is healed. Units under the effect of Disruption can still be affected by Demonic Cleanse. DISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_loc": ["Negative buffs are continously removed from the target for the duration of the Cleanse."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Cleanses the target allied unit, removing negative buffs for the duration. At the end of the duration, the unit is healed. Units under the effect of Disruption can still be affected by Demonic Cleanse. DISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_loc": ["Negative buffs are continously removed from the target for the duration of the Cleanse."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "cooldowns", "old": [60], "new": [40]}, {"field": "AbilityCooldown", "old": {"base": [60], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [40], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "purge_damage", "old": {"base": [450], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [425], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "58138da51240f888cf75", "mechanism": "applies_basic_dispel", "mechanism_zh": "施加弱驱散", "definition": "移除目标身上可被弱驱散的效果", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "f3eb3feeda51824f539b", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "shadow_demon_demonic_purge", "name_zh": "暗影恶魔·邪恶净化", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Purges the target enemy unit, removing positive buffs, and slowing the target for the duration. The unit slowly regains its speed until the end of the duration, upon which damage is dealt. Units under the effect of Disruption can still be affected by Demonic Purge. DISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_loc": ["The slow starts at %max_slow%%% and decreases over time to %min_slow%%%.", "Positive buffs are continously removed from the target for the duration of the Purge."], "scepter_loc": "Causes Demonic Purge to break and gain %max_charges% charges."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Purges the target enemy unit, removing positive buffs, and slowing the target for the duration. The unit slowly regains its speed until the end of the duration, upon which damage is dealt. Units under the effect of Disruption can still be affected by Demonic Purge. DISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_loc": ["The slow starts at %max_slow%%% and decreases over time to %min_slow%%%.", "Positive buffs are continously removed from the target for the duration of the Purge."], "scepter_loc": "Causes Demonic Purge to break and gain %max_charges% charges."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "purge_damage", "old": {"base": [300, 450, 600], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [300, 425, 550], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "da5250d628d7ce2a7b95", "mechanism": "applies_basic_dispel", "mechanism_zh": "施加弱驱散", "definition": "移除目标身上可被弱驱散的效果", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "4b15dde7096f8532f25d", "mechanism": "applies_break", "mechanism_zh": "施加破坏", "definition": "使目标的被动技能暂时失效", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "2720bb4f3bca0a31c0cc", "mechanism": "charges", "mechanism_zh": "充能", "definition": "技能或物品用一次消耗一点；只决定数值或层数的不算", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "883cefab73fe49e0e1ac", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "255bc488f55cb6334fca", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "shadow_shaman_fowl_play", "name_zh": "暗影萨满·禽戏", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "When taking lethal damage, Shadow Shaman receives a strong dispel and survives as a 1 HP chicken with increased movement speed. Incoming damage is reduced to zero for a short duration and additional chickens are created to confuse the enemy. Cooldown resets when Shadow Shaman respawns. DISPEL TYPE: Strong Dispel", "notes_loc": ["Lethal Damage from Axe's Culling Blade and Necrophos's Reaper's Scythe will not be prevented.", "Incoming damage reduction buff will prevent certain sources of HP removal from killing Shadow Shaman."], "shard_loc": "Increases the amount of time incoming damage is reduced to %damage_reduction_duration% seconds. When Fowl Play is triggered, Shadow Shaman becomes invulnerable for %invuln_duration% seconds. %chicken_illusions% additional uncontrollable chickens are created that last for %ally_voodoo_duration% seconds. While Shadow Shaman is transformed, he can now use items."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "When taking lethal damage, Shadow Shaman receives a strong dispel and survives as a 1 HP chicken with increased movement speed. Incoming damage is reduced to zero for a short duration and additional chickens are created to confuse the enemy. Cooldown resets when Shadow Shaman respawns. DISPEL TYPE: Strong Dispel", "notes_loc": ["Lethal Damage from Axe's Culling Blade and Necrophos's Reaper's Scythe will not be prevented.", "Incoming damage reduction buff will prevent certain sources of HP removal from killing Shadow Shaman."], "shard_loc": "Increases the amount of time incoming damage is reduced to %damage_reduction_duration% seconds. When Fowl Play is triggered, Shadow Shaman becomes invulnerable for %invuln_duration% seconds. %chicken_illusions% additional uncontrollable chickens are created that last for %ally_voodoo_duration% seconds. While Shadow Shaman is transformed, he can now use items."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "total_chickens", "old": {"base": [1], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [3], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "87645fc3557f3f41e03a", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "be94dcee83197e6b9c39", "mechanism": "applies_strong_dispel", "mechanism_zh": "施加强驱散", "definition": "移除目标身上可被强驱散的效果（含多数眩晕）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "a41282b88d3d1fd5911b", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:shadow_shaman_fowl_play:cooldown_reset:base", "mechanism": "cooldown_reset", "mechanism_zh": "刷新冷却", "definition": "立刻重置冷却", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "86107472b869ac2c47ec", "mechanism": "damage_block", "mechanism_zh": "护盾/伤害吸收/减伤", "definition": "吸收一定伤害、按比例减少受到的伤害，或把受到的伤害延迟结算（如统帅朗姆酒、虚妄之诺）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:shadow_shaman_fowl_play:death_prevention:base", "mechanism": "death_prevention", "mechanism_zh": "免死", "definition": "在一段时间内不会被打死（如薄葬、回光返照）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "c755a2c02f064a102785", "mechanism": "execute", "mechanism_zh": "斩杀", "definition": "目标低于生命阈值时直接杀死", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "31581fac66407dd57fbb", "mechanism": "haste", "mechanism_zh": "加速", "definition": "提升自身、自己的单位或友方的移动速度（顺带加一点移速的也算）；只让敌人变慢的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "2d33583d5e348fbdfdb6", "mechanism": "hex", "mechanism_zh": "妖术", "definition": "把目标变成无害小动物，期间无法攻击、施法和使用物品", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "3e875ccc5cadd4b47408", "mechanism": "hp_removal", "mechanism_zh": "生命移除", "definition": "直接移除生命，不算伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "f49a2778932c034dc275", "mechanism": "invulnerable_untargetable", "mechanism_zh": "无敌/不可选取", "definition": "暂时无法被伤害或无法被指向", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "a4bdf83b8f11d943a8ad", "mechanism": "respawn", "mechanism_zh": "重生", "definition": "死亡后复活，或影响复活", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "shadow_shaman_mass_serpent_ward", "name_zh": "暗影萨满·群蛇守卫", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Summons %ward_count% Serpent Wards to attack enemy units and structures. The Wards are immune to magic. Creeps deal half damage to the Serpent Ward.", "shard_loc": "Allows to create a Mega Ward using the Urnaconda ability.", "facets_loc": ["Summons a single massive Serpent Ward with %mega_ward_multiplier_damage%x damage and %mega_ward_multiplier_health%x health and bounty values."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Summons %ward_count% Serpent Wards to attack enemy units and structures. The Wards are immune to magic. Creeps and illusions deal 25% damage to the Serpent Ward.", "shard_loc": "Allows to create a Mega Ward using the Urnaconda ability.", "facets_loc": ["Summons a single massive Serpent Ward with %mega_ward_multiplier_damage%x damage and %mega_ward_multiplier_health%x health and bounty values."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "cooldowns", "old": [110, 105, 100], "new": [110]}, {"field": "AbilityCooldown", "old": {"base": [110, 105, 100], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [110], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "ward_health", "old": {"base": [4], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [2], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "096b36ae8f678064bdc4", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "audit:shadow_shaman_mass_serpent_ward:debuff_immunity:base", "mechanism": "debuff_immunity", "mechanism_zh": "减益免疫/技能免疫", "definition": "处于减益免疫（技能免疫）时，只有能无视减益免疫的效果才对其生效（如碎颅锤的重击可以眩晕开了黑皇杖的单位）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "15f348bdf92ded494a2b", "mechanism": "summons", "mechanism_zh": "召唤物", "definition": "召唤有血量的单位（可控或不可控都算），以及夺取已有单位的控制权；按受攻击次数计算的单位和死亡守卫不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "shadow_shaman_urnaconda", "name_zh": "暗影萨满·巨蟒之瓮", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Throw a snake jar at the target location, damaging all enemies in the AoE and creating a Massive Serpent Ward that has %megaward_multiplier_tooltip%x the base Serpent Ward damage and health there that lasts %ward_duration%s."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Throw a snake jar at the target location, damaging all enemies in the AoE and creating a Massive Serpent Ward that has %megaward_multiplier_tooltip%x the base Serpent Ward damage and pip health there that lasts %ward_duration%s."}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "f203e4f2844cd48e8ebf", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "shadow_shaman_voodoo", "name_zh": "暗影萨满·妖术", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Transforms an enemy unit into a harmless creature, disabling their attacks and abilities.", "notes_loc": ["Instantly destroys illusions.", "The target will have a base movement speed of %movespeed%, but buffs granting maximum movement speed won't be disabled."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Transforms an enemy unit into a harmless creature, disabling their attacks and abilities.", "notes_loc": ["Instantly destroys illusions.", "The target will have a base movement speed of %movespeed%, but buffs granting maximum movement speed won't be disabled."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "mana_costs", "old": [130, 150, 170, 190], "new": [120, 140, 160, 180]}, {"field": "AbilityManaCost", "old": {"base": [130, 150, 170, 190], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [120, 140, 160, 180], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:shadow_shaman_voodoo:hex:base", "mechanism": "hex", "mechanism_zh": "妖术", "definition": "把目标变成无害小动物，期间无法攻击、施法和使用物品", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "c5d98b893f93ed0bf715", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "shivas_guard", "name_zh": "希瓦的守护", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Active: Arctic Blast Emits a freezing wave that deals %blast_damage% magical damage to enemies and slows their movement by %blast_movement_speed%%% for %blast_debuff_duration% seconds. Radius: %blast_radius% Passive: Freezing Aura Reduces the attack speed of all enemies by %aura_attack_speed%. Radius: %aura_radius%", "notes_loc": ["The wave extends at a speed of %blast_speed% to a max size of %blast_radius%.", "The Arctic Blast follows its caster.", "Multiple instances of Freezing Aura do not stack.", "AoE bonuses from multiple Chasm Stones or its upgrades do not stack."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Active: Arctic Blast Emits a freezing wave that deals %blast_damage% magical damage to enemies and slows their movement by %blast_movement_speed%%% for %blast_debuff_duration% seconds. Radius: %blast_radius% Passive: Freezing Aura Reduces the attack speed of all enemies by %aura_attack_speed%. Radius: %aura_radius%", "notes_loc": ["The wave extends at a speed of %blast_speed% to a max size of %blast_radius%.", "The Arctic Blast follows its caster.", "Multiple instances of Freezing Aura do not stack.", "AoE bonuses from multiple Chasm Stones or its upgrades do not stack."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "blast_movement_speed", "old": {"base": [-40], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [-30], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "blast_radius", "old": {"base": [825], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [840], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "bonus_aoe", "old": {"base": [75], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [60], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "d2f1225e5720447d6c13", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:shivas_guard:attack_slow:item", "mechanism": "attack_slow", "mechanism_zh": "减攻速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的攻击速度", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "bd5e7f685a37cce778af", "mechanism": "aura", "mechanism_zh": "光环", "definition": "跟着单位持续影响周围单位；对友军或敌方都算，并记作用对象；固定在地上的区域归场地魔法", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "03afee5ba76ad62c8516", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "2a683c07e48aa391cde1", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "shredder_chakram", "name_zh": "伐木机·锯齿飞轮", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Fires Timbersaw's main saw blade at the target location where it will spin in place, dealing damage in an area around it. Enemies caught in the saw blade will move more slowly for every %slow_health_percentage%%% of health missing. The blade deals damage and cuts down trees in its path when fired and retracted. While active the ability costs mana, and Timbersaw loses the ability to attack.", "notes_loc": ["The Chakram will return if Timbersaw runs out of mana or moves over %break_distance% distance away."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Fires Timbersaw's main saw blade at the target location where it will spin in place, dealing damage in an area around it. Enemies caught in the saw blade will move more slowly for every %slow_health_percentage%%% of health missing. The blade deals damage and cuts down trees in its path when fired and retracted. While active the ability costs mana, and Timbersaw loses the ability to attack.", "notes_loc": ["The Chakram will return if Timbersaw runs out of mana or moves over %break_distance% distance away."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "damage_per_second", "old": {"base": [50, 75, 100], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [50, 70, 90], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "pass_damage", "old": {"base": [75, 150, 225], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [70, 140, 210], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "c8b92d47570408bbaf1f", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:shredder_chakram:ground_zone:base", "mechanism": "ground_zone", "mechanism_zh": "场地魔法", "definition": "在地面某个位置留下一块持续一段时间的作用区域，单位留在其中就持续受影响（如寒冰之墙、臭云、烟幕）；区域跟着单位走的归光环，瞬间生效一次的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "c28be5be630ea02530f5", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "79c49751d5a13002f9e5", "mechanism": "tree_destroy", "mechanism_zh": "砍树", "definition": "能摧毁树木", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "shredder_exposure_therapy", "name_zh": "伐木机·暴露疗法", "category": "4_行为/目标/驱散/免疫/A杖魔晶", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Whenever Timbersaw destroys a tree, he gains mana."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Whenever Timbersaw destroys a tree, he gains mana."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "behavior", "old": "8796093022274", "new": "562949953421379"}], "rows": [{"review_id": "4838c3ce00b15dceaaec", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "de5d04076add77f8f92a", "mechanism": "mana_gain", "mechanism_zh": "自身回蓝/吸蓝", "definition": "为自己恢复或从其他单位抽取法力（如莱恩法力吸取），含属性回蓝和回蓝倍率；对友军生效且能给自己回蓝的也算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "0093a2a0f4957670c27e", "mechanism": "tree_destroy", "mechanism_zh": "砍树", "definition": "能摧毁树木", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "shredder_whirling_death", "name_zh": "伐木机·死亡旋风", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Timbersaw whirls extremely sharp edges, damaging enemies and destroying trees around him in an area. If an enemy hero is affected, it loses some of its primary attribute for a short duration. Whirling Death will deal bonus damage per tree destroyed."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Timbersaw whirls extremely sharp edges, damaging enemies and destroying trees around him in an area. If an enemy hero is affected, it loses some of its primary attribute for a short duration. Whirling Death will deal bonus damage per tree destroyed."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "tree_damage_scale", "old": {"base": [9, 16, 23, 30], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [7, 14, 21, 28], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "b451395e3385a60c88fb", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "5b55a6c0c7d2abf882d3", "mechanism": "tree_destroy", "mechanism_zh": "砍树", "definition": "能摧毁树木", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "silencer_brain_drain", "name_zh": "沉默术士·默默受苦", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Silencer takes less damage from and deals more damage to silenced targets. If an enemy Hero dies within %permanent_int_steal_range% range of Silencer or was debuffed by Silencer at the time of death, Silencer permanently steals %permanent_int_steal_amount% Intelligence from them. If the victim was silenced, steal an extra %silenced_bonus_int_steal_amount% Intelligence.", "shard_loc": "Increases the Intelligence stolen per kill."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Silencer takes less damage from and deals more damage to silenced targets. If an enemy Hero dies within %permanent_int_steal_range% range of Silencer or was debuffed by Silencer at the time of death, Silencer permanently steals %permanent_int_steal_amount% Intelligence from them. If the victim was silenced, steal an extra %silenced_bonus_int_steal_amount% Intelligence.", "notes_loc": ["Intelligence Steal is not disabled by Break."], "shard_loc": "Increases the Intelligence stolen per kill."}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "485737df55fab252c432", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "audit:silencer_brain_drain:damage_block:base", "mechanism": "damage_block", "mechanism_zh": "护盾/伤害吸收/减伤", "definition": "吸收一定伤害、按比例减少受到的伤害，或把受到的伤害延迟结算（如统帅朗姆酒、虚妄之诺）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:silencer_brain_drain:incoming_damage_amp:base", "mechanism": "incoming_damage_amp", "mechanism_zh": "伤害加深", "definition": "让目标受到更多物理伤害或全部伤害（只加深魔法的归上一项）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "f36afe926360415660b0", "mechanism": "silence", "mechanism_zh": "沉默", "definition": "目标无法施放技能（仍可攻击、使用物品）", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "d7fe0dfebc9d66897d2d", "mechanism": "stat_steal", "mechanism_zh": "偷属性", "definition": "夺取目标的属性", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "silencer_glaives_of_wisdom", "name_zh": "沉默术士·智慧之刃", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Silencer enchants his glaives with his wisdom, stealing his target's Intelligence with each hit and dealing additional damage based on his Intelligence.", "shard_loc": "Causes Glaives of Wisdom to bounce %bounce_count% time to a random enemy within %bounce_range% range and increases intelligence steal.", "facets_loc": ["Increases the max level of Glaives of Wisdom. Level %max_level_tooltip% Glaives of Wisdom bounce %bounce_count_tooltip% time to a random target within %bounce_range_tooltip% range. The bounce costs mana upon hit and prioritizes heroes."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Silencer enchants his glaives with his wisdom, stealing his target's Intelligence with each hit and dealing additional damage based on his Intelligence.", "shard_loc": "Causes Glaives of Wisdom to bounce %bounce_count% time to a random enemy within %bounce_range% range and increases intelligence steal.", "facets_loc": ["Increases the max level of Glaives of Wisdom. Level %max_level_tooltip% Glaives of Wisdom bounce %bounce_count_tooltip% time to a random target within %bounce_range_tooltip% range. The bounce costs mana upon hit and prioritizes heroes."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "int_steal", "old": {"base": [2, 3, 4, 5], "scepter": null, "shard": [1]}, "new": {"base": [2, 3, 4, 5], "scepter": null, "shard": [2]}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:silencer_glaives_of_wisdom:aoe_damage:shard", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "06e572d4bf492c0e9b74", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "b9fd537ed85efcc267aa", "mechanism": "silence", "mechanism_zh": "沉默", "definition": "目标无法施放技能（仍可攻击、使用物品）", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "ac5a42db12da5bece3ff", "mechanism": "stat_steal", "mechanism_zh": "偷属性", "definition": "夺取目标的属性", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "a8c7c810bda951f613a7", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "silver_edge", "name_zh": "白银之锋", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Active: Shadow Walk Makes you invisible for %windwalk_duration% seconds, or until you attack or cast a spell. While invisible, you move %windwalk_movement_speed%%% faster and can move through units. Attacking to end the invisibility will deal %windwalk_bonus_damage% bonus physical damage, disable their passive abilities for %backstab_duration% seconds, and cap their movement speed to %max_movement_speed%."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Active: Shadow Walk Makes you invisible for %windwalk_duration% seconds, or until you attack or cast a spell. While invisible, you move %windwalk_movement_speed%%% faster and can move through units. Attacking to end the invisibility will deal %windwalk_bonus_damage% bonus physical damage, disable their passive abilities for %backstab_duration% seconds, and cap their movement speed to %max_movement_speed%."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "windwalk_movement_speed", "old": {"base": [20], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [18], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "5749ab853da56d2c0dcb", "mechanism": "applies_break", "mechanism_zh": "施加破坏", "definition": "使目标的被动技能暂时失效", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:silver_edge:attack_modifier:item", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "040550da413f32214b69", "mechanism": "haste", "mechanism_zh": "加速", "definition": "提升自身、自己的单位或友方的移动速度（顺带加一点移速的也算）；只让敌人变慢的不算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "83b72c363a023078f0c2", "mechanism": "invisibility", "mechanism_zh": "隐身", "definition": "使自身、队友、召唤物或复制体隐身", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:silver_edge:phased:item", "mechanism": "phased", "mechanism_zh": "相位移动", "definition": "移动不受单位碰撞阻挡", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:silver_edge:slow:item", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "skadi", "name_zh": "斯嘉蒂之眼", "category": "4_行为/目标/驱散/免疫/A杖魔晶", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Passive: Cold Attack Attacks lower enemy movement by %cold_slow_melee%%% if they are melee and %cold_slow_ranged%%% if they are ranged. Attacks also lower enemy attack speed by %cold_attack_slow_melee%%% and Health Restoration by %restoration_reduction%%%. Lasts for %cold_duration% seconds."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Passive: Cold Attack Attacks lower enemy movement by %cold_slow_melee%%% if they are melee and %cold_slow_ranged%%% if they are ranged. Attacks also lower enemy attack speed by %cold_attack_slow_melee%%% and Health Restoration by %restoration_reduction%%%. Lasts for %cold_duration% seconds."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "flags", "old": 0, "new": 16}, {"field": "cold_slow_melee", "old": {"base": [-25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [-20], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "cold_slow_ranged", "old": {"base": [-50], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [-40], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:skadi:attack_modifier:item", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:skadi:attack_slow:item", "mechanism": "attack_slow", "mechanism_zh": "减攻速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的攻击速度", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "b3fb210d5160471afc78", "mechanism": "heal_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "治疗削减", "definition": "降低或禁止目标的任何形式生命恢复，含属性回复；提升生命上限的效果不受影响", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "70c1ed32fadd612d1c9d", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "skeleton_king_bone_guard", "name_zh": "冥魂大帝·白骨护卫", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Gains a Charge for every 2 creeps killed and 2 charges per hero killed. Activate to spend all charges, summoning skeletons that respawn once when killed. Skeletons benefit from Vampiric Spirit's lifesteal.", "notes_loc": ["Break disables the gaining of new stacks.", "Casting Wraithfire Blast on an enemy causes the skeletons to attack that enemy."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Gains a Charge for every 2 creeps killed and 2 charges per hero killed. Activate to spend all charges, summoning skeletons that respawn once when killed. Skeletons benefit from Vampiric Spirit's lifesteal.", "notes_loc": ["Break disables the gaining of new stacks.", "Casting Wraithfire Blast on an enemy causes the skeletons to attack that enemy."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "cooldowns", "old": [42], "new": [45]}, {"field": "AbilityCooldown", "old": {"base": [42], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [45], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "max_skeleton_charges", "old": {"base": [2, 4, 6, 8], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [3, 4, 5, 6], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "skeleton_bonus_hero_damage", "old": {"base": [25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [24, 28, 32, 36], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "5246ea65479887e0078a", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "a8e0158da70d65a2dcd5", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "ae3568b9d901513a8f9c", "mechanism": "charges", "mechanism_zh": "充能", "definition": "技能或物品用一次消耗一点；只决定数值或层数的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "df56f04a8a8da59bb1f5", "mechanism": "lifesteal", "mechanism_zh": "吸血", "definition": "攻击或技能恢复自身生命：按造成的伤害、按目标生命或每次攻击固定值（攻击吸血、技能吸血、如噬魂鬼·盛宴、附魂面具）", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "3f766387df29867f96c6", "mechanism": "respawn", "mechanism_zh": "重生", "definition": "死亡后复活，或影响复活", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "e9e16237ad7a7955cf4d", "mechanism": "summons", "mechanism_zh": "召唤物", "definition": "召唤有血量的单位（可控或不可控都算），以及夺取已有单位的控制权；按受攻击次数计算的单位和死亡守卫不算", "c